(text "FRONT PANEL. 12x CTS 228EMVARGBFR IP67 RGB-backlit tactile switches. Switch -> TCA9555 @0x20 (internal pull-ups).\nBacklight: common anodes on BTN_LED_V (+5V via AO3401A high-side, gated by CM5 GPIO13 BTN_BL_PWM = global dimming, default off).\nCathodes R/G/B per button via 330R/330R/200R (~8-9mA) to TCA9555 @0x21/@0x24/@0x25, active low. OFF = pin set as input (Hi-Z)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 12 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d8f65b39-ba7a-4174-a830-647683342daf"))
)
